===Etymology===
Via {{bor|en|de|Sudeten|Sudeten-}}; the name was used by Ptolemy as {{m|grc|Σούδητα ὄρη}},<ref>Ptolemy - Geographia 2.11</ref> but is of uncertain origin. {{uder|en|xil|-}} has been suggested.<ref> Room, Adrian, Place Names of the World, 2nd ed., McFarland & Co., 2006. </ref>

